{
  "expand": "renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations",
  "id": "10231",
  "self": "https://simeoncalixte1990.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10231",
  "key": "AIN-2",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "[Ensured] Complete production ingestion, orchestration and searchable artifacts",
    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Completion review: 2026-11-01. Scope: current local EnsureMarketPlace checkout plus existing Jira inventory. This is a code/document review, not a production audit. Existing implementations are to be extended. No full test suite was run."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Delivery: Insurer pilot | Planning priority: P0 (P0 = pilot blocker; P1 = next delivery priority)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Observed state and evidence"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "EnsuredPipelineStorageSearch/src/pipeline/storageSearch/service.ts returns the received payload without indexing. API pipeline/jobs already implements queued advance/rerun work; standalone ingestion, OCR, extraction and normalization packages exist."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Scope"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Implement tenant-scoped artifact indexing/retrieval and indexing lifecycle instead of the Storage Search passthrough."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Verify real supported intake channels through the existing worker with idempotency, retry, cancellation, dead-letter handling and provider timeouts."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Keep source document lineage, extraction confidence and append-only replay across partial failures; protect document processing from hostile content."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance criteria"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A non-seeded intake reaches persisted searchable artifacts and downstream stages with source/execution lineage."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Duplicate deliveries and worker restarts do not duplicate submissions or external side effects; failures remain actionable."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Search enforces tenant access and deletion/retention policy; representative PDF, table/SOV and email fixtures succeed or report explicit errors."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dependencies"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Establish a reproducible, operable platform release"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Implementation constraints"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Preserve working functionality, tenant isolation, additive migrations and append-only audit/replay. Keep engines driven by risk-class configuration. Do not present seeded/illustrative figures as verified financial results. Owners and estimates remain unassigned until delivery planning."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Single-developer sprint sequence \u2014 2026-11-04"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Roadmap priority 3 of 14 open epics. One developer, two-week sprints"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "S07 Document financial provenance: AIN-15"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "S08 Reliable intake execution: AIN-131"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "S09 Authorized evidence search: AIN-16"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Historical epic-level Blocks links remain intact as delivery/release constraints. Readiness for a child uses the named prerequisite milestone, not completion of every late child of a foundational epic. AIN-1 provides build/staging foundations early and full integration/restore late; AIN-47 contracts are early and legacy cutover late. No epic is closed at an early milestone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Existing active sprint remains active with original dates; only its goal/name and unfinished membership are reorganized. Every new sprint is future and undated. No fabricated story-point/time estimates or assignees. The ordered slots are a provisional work breakdown, not a fixed delivery forecast. Before activation, split any candidate exceeding six implementation days and verify reviewer/provider readiness; preserve all parent acceptance criteria."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Epic completion requires every original criterion, unfinished child/subtask and required dependency, including criteria not exhausted by the sprint issue titles. Early foundation milestones do not close this epic. Full backlog mapping and gate register are recorded on AIN-12 and in TASK_HANDOFF.md."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
